5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Let's find a way to fix the bins so everyone is happy and we can all be friends again!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. We should look into how other blocks handle this so we don't make things worse.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need hard data. I want to know the actual time commitment and the ward's official requirements.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,It's not fair that one person always has the bins. We need to check the space in front of every house.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,A wise approach. We must also consider the financial burden to ensure no one is strained by the costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that's a great point! Maybe we should see if the ward has a list of complaints to see what's wrong.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if the station block's bin house is a good idea. I'll look into their experience.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if we are talking money, we should check the block ledger and any available subsidies.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll check the measurements of our frontages and the complaint log to see who is struggling.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I will look into the subsidy and the ledger as well, to see the full financial picture.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the meeting minutes from the station block to see if they fought about it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'll also look at the supervised mornings on the next lane to see if that's a peaceful option.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the filing requirements and the supervised mornings to calculate the labor.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
