60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option A seems like it would lead to fights over repairs. Option B or C sounds better.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option C sounds like a lot of work every morning. Option B seems more balanced.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B requires a notice for every change, which is a hassle. Option C is more efficient.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B is the only one that is truly equal for everyone's front gate!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option A is too expensive for some. Option B and C are more budget-friendly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, is the paperwork for Option B really that bad? I'd rather do papers than fight.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, would moving the bins every few months be too disruptive for the street?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"It is tedious. However, Option C relies on people being ""police,"" which usually fails.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I think the effort of moving the bins is better than the unfairness of one person having them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Rin. A rotating system avoids a large debt and distributes the burden.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm leaning towards B. It feels like the most ""together"" way to do it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If the others are okay with it, I can support B. It avoids the smell of a shelter.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we accept the administrative burden, B is the most logical way to ensure fairness.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I definitely vote for B! It's the only fair way.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I also vote for B. It protects everyone's wallet and shares the responsibility.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,It's settled then! Let's go with the rotation.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I'm happy we all agree.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will handle the initial notices to the ward.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Everyone gets a turn!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,A harmonious conclusion. Let us move forward with kindness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
